### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost/api
@contentType = application/json

### ==================== AUTH ====================
### Login para obtener token admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "password"
}

### Guardar como @adminToken (respuesta del login)
### @adminToken = <token_aqui>

### Login para obtener token usuario normal
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Guardar como @userToken (respuesta del login)
### @userToken = <token_aqui>

### ==================== REGISTRO Y CREACIÓN ====================

### 1. Registrar nuevo usuario (público)
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "nickname": "newuser123",
  "name": "Juan",
  "lastname": "Pérez",
  "email": "juan@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "password_confirmation": "password123",
  "birthdate": "1990-05-15"
}

### 2. Crear usuario (público - sin protección)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "nickname": "testuser",
  "name": "Test",
  "lastname": "User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "birthdate": "1995-03-20",
  "profile_url": null
}

### ==================== LISTADOS Y CONSULTAS ====================

### 3. Obtener todos los usuarios (requiere admin + ability list-users)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### 4. Obtener usuario por ID (requiere admin + ability view-user)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### 5. Obtener usuario actual (requiere autenticación + ability show-itself)
GET {{baseUrl}}/user
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### ==================== ACTUALIZACIONES ====================

### 6. Actualizar usuario por ID (requiere admin + ability update-user)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/2
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "nickname": "userupdated",
  "name": "Nombre Actualizado",
  "lastname": "Apellido Actualizado",
  "email": "updated@example.com",
  "password": "newpassword123",
  "password_confirmation": "newpassword123",
  "birthdate": "1992-07-10"
}

### 7. Actualizar usuario actual (requiere autenticación + ability update-itself)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "nickname": "myupdateduser",
  "name": "Mi Nombre",
  "lastname": "Mi Apellido",
  "email": "myemail@example.com",
  "birthdate": "1993-11-25"
}

### 8. Actualizar contraseña (requiere autenticación + ability update-itself)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/password
Authorization: Bearer 1|GtPVf32jG9aAdrowq0t0wqEDbno2VwSAbtzjvLNC7e83eb38
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "oldPassword": "password",
  "password": "newpassword456"
}

### ==================== GESTIÓN DE ROLES ====================

### 9. Asignar rol a usuario (requiere admin + ability assign-roles)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/3/roles
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "roles": 2
}

### ==================== ELIMINACIONES ====================

### 10. Eliminar usuario por ID (requiere admin + ability delete-user)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/4
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### 11. Eliminar usuario actual (requiere autenticación + ability delete-itself)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### ==================== LOGOUT ====================

### 12. Logout (requiere autenticación)
POST {{baseUrl}}/logout
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
